14. calculate sales tax;
15. distinguish tax amount from total cost;
16. calculate or estimate tips;
17. calculate percent increase;
18. calculate percent decrease;
19. distinguish absolute change from percent change;
20. evaluate whether a percentage answer is reasonable;
